# Optional cloud sync (sign-in + cross-device progress backup).
# The app works fully offline without any of this — only fill it in if you
# want to sync progress across devices. See README "Optional cloud sync".
#
# 1. Create a free project at https://console.firebase.google.com
# 2. Add a Web App to it, copy the config values below.
# 3. Enable Authentication -> Sign-in method -> Google.
# 4. Enable Firestore Database (production mode) and set rules so each user
#    can only read/write their own document (see README for the rule).
# 5. Copy this file to .env.local (which is gitignored) and fill in values.

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
